  m_text: Each reel contains a number of adjacent positions that, before the reel
    spin initiates, are randomly replaced with a symbol from the paytable except
    FEATURE. Only highest winner paid per winning combination on each reel set. Line
    pays must occur on adjacent reels, beginning with the leftmost reel on each reel
    set. Paytable reflects current bet configuration. Line pays do not continue from
    one reel set to the next.
