  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: During free spins, an alternate set of reels is used for each reel set.
    The bet per line and the active paylines remain the same as the spin that triggered
    the feature. Winning combinations for these reels are identical to the base game.
    Only highest winner paid per winning combination on each reel set. Scatter pays
    are multiplied by the total bet. Scatter pays are added to payline wins.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25be53c9d801a4ed3a6ee2608a99e67d, type: 2}
